---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro"; import FdeNav from "../../components/FdeNav.astro";
---
<Base title="FDE Compensation Evidence | FDE Commons" description="A careful framework for interpreting FDE compensation across level, location, role variant, travel, and equity." pageSlug="career-compensation"><FdeNav/><div class="shell comp"><header><p class="eyebrow">COMPENSATION</p><h1>Compare the operating contract, not only base salary.</h1><p>FDE compensation changes quickly and varies by location, level, specialization, travel, clearance, commission structure, and equity. FDE Commons does not publish fabricated market averages.</p></header><section><h2>Normalize the evidence</h2><div>{["Base salary range and location","Target bonus or variable compensation","Equity type, grant, and vesting","Travel and on-site expectation","On-call and customer escalation load","Level and direct code ownership","Clearance or domain premium","Source date and official posting"].map((x,i)=><article><span>{String(i+1).padStart(2,"0")}</span>{x}</article>)}</div></section><section class="rule"><p class="eyebrow">EVIDENCE RULE</p><blockquote>A range without its role variant, location, level, and verification date is not useful compensation intelligence.</blockquote><a class="btn btn--solid" href="/career/jobs/">Inspect official openings →</a></section></div></Base>
<style>.comp{max-width:950px}.comp header{padding:7rem 0}.comp h1{font-size:clamp(3.5rem,7vw,7rem);max-width:14ch}.comp header>p:last-child{color:var(--fg-muted)}.comp section{padding:5rem 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.comp section>div{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.comp article{padding:1rem;border:1px solid var(--line);font-weight:650}.comp article span{font:500 .62rem var(--font-mono);color:var(--accent);margin-right:1rem}.rule{background:#fff1e6;margin-inline:calc(50% - 50vw);padding-inline:max(var(--pad),calc((100vw - 950px)/2 + var(--pad)))!important}.rule blockquote{border:0;font-size:clamp(2rem,4vw,4rem);color:var(--fg)}@media(max-width:600px){.comp section>div{grid-template-columns:1fr}}</style>
